    <briefdescription>
<para>A simple futex mock for verifying safety and liveness. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This mock has less overhead than <computeroutput><ref refid="futex__mock__liveness_8h_source" kindref="compound">futex_mock_liveness.h</ref></computeroutput> one, but at the cost of not supporting futex_requeue operations and verification failures when two futexes hash to the same bucket. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
